From 426da4fcc4cf5c228ff64380c99f26ed8b5a617d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Ferreira <gabrielcarvfer@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 16:50:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] spectrum: Optimize the 3GPP channel and propagation loss
 model

Speed up GetNewChannel and the ThreeGppSpectrumPropagationLossModel receive pipeline by 8-11x per link on a representative system-level workload (19-site hex, 20 UEs, 100-RB carrier, -O2):

  2x8 dual-pol panels:  19.6 ms -> 1.8 ms per link
  4x4 / 2x2 sub-array:   2.4 ms -> 0.29 ms per link

RX PSD matches the previous implementation to ~1e-14 relative error, validated over 240 links x 100 RBs in two antenna/port configs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
